OL,3,GNEWSASupercar designer gifts robot
OL,4,Aafter cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has taken delivery of a
OL,7,Fstate-of-the-art surgical robot, thanks
OL,8,Fto a donation from a sports car
OL,9,Fdesigner.
OL,11,FGordon Murray, who created the McLaren
OL,12,FF1 supercar in 1992, has paid for the
OL,13,FDa Vinci Five robot for the Royal
OL,14,FSurrey County Hospital in Guildford
OL,15,Fafter having robotic-assisted surgery
OL,16,Ffor oesophageal cancer in 2024.
OL,18,FHe has named the robot George after his
OL,19,Ffriend, the Beatle George Harrison, who
OL,20,Fdied of cancer.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
