OL,3,GNEWSASupercar designer gifts robot
OL,4,Aafter cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It makes something like winning the
OL,7,F24-hours of Le Mans seem insignificant,
OL,8,Fthis is going to save lives," he told
OL,9,FBBC Radio Surrey.
